              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ok onyal bedo gi thuolo mar nono kit ngimane e ndalo mosekadho, nikech Nyasaye okete modich gi mor mathoth e chunye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.5.20",
